rue, "yearly_report_client_visible": false, "total_appeals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@Eviprostat/works/16", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 253208, "client_id": 2458186, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/43961d84/uploads/origins/e872ea4f-5631-44ee-a10b-a8887f0fc451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46137f28d2916ad452c6f09cf0fe971d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/43961d84/uploads/origins/e872ea4f-5631-44ee-a10b-a8887f0fc451?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6126a93948b3361e2147cbfbb80f2226", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの絵が大好きです！友達のルルと私のキャラクターを一緒に描いた作品をお願いしたいです。ポーズはこの作品（https://skeb.jp/@Eviprostat/works/7）のようなものを希望していますが、他のポーズがあればそれも構いません！私のリクエストに時間を割いていただき、ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/kintsugigio-friendkomori-lulu-bf1DPTn", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Eviprostat/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 253208, "client_id": 3517033, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dc9ac6ce/uploads/origins/365377f1-7ccf-4a0a-bb52-3e3385a4b1b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=761adb2f61126f06eb5a379dc90aa550", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dc9ac6ce/uploads/origins/365377f1-7ccf-4a0a-bb52-3e3385a4b1b0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e62fb4c10723c0e5dbcd8daf8ea5cce4", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Came across your artwork and instantly fell in love with it! I was wondering if you could do an illustration for